<script setup lang="ts">
import {computed,ref} from 'vue'
import Icon from './Icon.vue'
import type {AppState} from './types'
const props=defineProps<{state:AppState;busy:string}>()
const emit=defineEmits<{action:[method:string,params:Record<string,unknown>,message:string];navigate:[page:string]}>()
const presets=[{id:'speed',title:'速度优先',icon:'bolt',description:'双入口错峰竞速，优先减少慢线路等待。',detail:'2 次尝试 · 10 秒预算 · 100 ms 错峰'},{id:'balanced',title:'自适应均衡',icon:'layers',description:'根据近期耗时排序，连续故障后降权。',detail:'4 次尝试 · 25 秒预算 · TCP 保活'},{id:'resilient',title:'波动恢复',icon:'shield',description:'为较长的 VPN 波动保留恢复时间。',detail:'6 次尝试 · 45 秒预算 · 更积极保活'}]
const strategyNames={ordered:'按配置顺序',adaptive:'自适应排序',race:'错峰竞速'}
const measure=computed(()=>props.state.network?.measure)
const series=computed(()=>{const samples=props.state.telemetry.series || [];const end=samples.at(-1)?.at || 0;return samples.filter(s=>s.at>=end-180)})
const hover=ref(-1)
const rate=(n:number)=>n>=1048576?`${(n/1048576).toFixed(2)} MB/s`:`${(n/1024).toFixed(1)} KB/s`
const latest=computed(()=>series.value.at(-1))
const ceiling=computed(()=>Math.max(1024,...series.value.flatMap(s=>[s.up_bps,s.down_bps]))*1.12)
const plot=computed(()=>{
 const last=series.value.at(-1)?.at || Date.now()/1000,first=Math.min(last-180,series.value[0]?.at || last-180)
 return series.value.map(s=>({...s,x:43+(s.at-first)/(last-first)*510,upY:153-s.up_bps/ceiling.value*125,downY:153-s.down_bps/ceiling.value*125}))
})
const line=(direction:'upY'|'downY')=>plot.value.map((s,i)=>`${i?'L':'M'}${s.x.toFixed(2)},${s[direction].toFixed(2)}`).join(' ')
const settled=computed(()=>props.state.telemetry.counters.connected+(props.state.telemetry.counters.connect_failed || 0))
const success=computed(()=>settled.value?props.state.telemetry.counters.connected/settled.value*100:null)
const milliseconds=(n?:number)=>n===undefined||n===null?'—':`${Math.round(n)} ms`
function pointer(event:PointerEvent){const b=(event.currentTarget as SVGElement).getBoundingClientRect();const x=(event.clientX-b.left)/b.width*580;let nearest=-1,distance=Infinity;plot.value.forEach((p,i)=>{if(Math.abs(p.x-x)<distance){distance=Math.abs(p.x-x);nearest=i}});hover.value=nearest}
const benchmarkStale=computed(()=>measure.value?.stale || (!!measure.value?.finished && Date.now()/1000-measure.value.finished>300))
</script>
<template>
<section class="network-toolkit">
 <div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow muted">TUNE YOUR CONNECTION</span><h3>选择连接节奏</h3><p>策略立即保存，应用于新连接。当前：{{ strategyNames[state.config.route_strategy] || '自适应排序' }}。</p></div><button class="text-button" @click="emit('navigate','settings')">精细设置<Icon name="chevron" :size="15"/></button></div>
 <div class="network-presets"><button v-for="preset in presets" :key="preset.id" class="panel preset-card" :class="{selected:state.network?.preset===preset.id}" :aria-pressed="state.network?.preset===preset.id" :disabled="!!busy || state.operation.running || measure?.running" @click="emit('action','network.preset',{name:preset.id},'已保存连接策略，新连接使用新参数。')"><span class="preset-heading"><Icon :name="preset.icon"/><strong>{{ preset.title }}</strong><Icon v-if="state.network?.preset===preset.id" name="check" :size="16"/></span><span class="preset-description">{{ preset.description }}</span><small>{{ preset.detail }}</small></button></div>
 <div v-if="state.config.upstreams.length<2" class="notice neutral"><Icon name="info"/><span>目前只有一个代理入口。配置第二个独立、可用的入口后可使用竞速与故障切换；同一 VPN 节点的两个端口不会叠加带宽。</span></div>
 <div class="network-visual-grid"><article class="panel throughput-panel"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow muted">LIVE TRANSFER</span><h3>实时传输</h3></div><span class="badge">中继实际字节</span></div><div class="transfer-rates"><span><i class="legend-up"></i>上传<strong>{{ rate(latest?.up_bps || 0) }}</strong></span><span><i class="legend-down"></i>下载<strong>{{ rate(latest?.down_bps || 0) }}</strong></span></div><div class="network-plot"><svg viewBox="0 0 580 186" role="img" :aria-label="`中继上传${rate(latest?.up_bps || 0)}，下载${rate(latest?.down_bps || 0)}`" @pointermove="pointer" @pointerleave="hover=-1"><g class="network-axes"><path d="M43 28H553M43 90H553M43 153H553"/><text x="0" y="22">{{ rate(ceiling).replace('/s','') }}</text><text x="23" y="157">0</text><text x="43" y="177">近 3 分钟</text><text x="525" y="177">现在</text></g><path :d="line('upY')" class="transfer-up"/><path :d="line('downY')" class="transfer-down"/><g v-if="plot[hover]"><path :d="`M${plot[hover].x} 28V153`" class="chart-crosshair"/><circle :cx="plot[hover].x" :cy="plot[hover].downY" r="3" class="transfer-down-dot"/></g></svg><div v-if="!series.length" class="network-plot-empty">连接后按实际传输采样</div><div v-if="plot[hover]" class="chart-tooltip">{{ new Date(plot[hover].at*1000).toLocaleTimeString('zh-CN',{hour12:false}) }}<strong>↑ {{ rate(plot[hover].up_bps) }} · ↓ {{ rate(plot[hover].down_bps) }}</strong></div></div><p class="micro-copy">显示经过 AI Link 的流量，包含检测请求；采样速率不是线路最大带宽。</p></article>
 <article class="panel connection-quality"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow muted">CONNECTION QUALITY</span><h3>连接质量</h3></div><Icon name="pulse" :size="19"/></div><div class="quality-body"><div class="quality-ring"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 120" role="img" :aria-label="success===null?'暂无已完成建连样本':`建连成功率${success.toFixed(1)}%`"><circle class="quality-track" cx="60" cy="60" r="48"/><circle class="quality-value" cx="60" cy="60" r="48" :stroke-dasharray="`${(success || 0)*3.016} 301.6`"/></svg><div><strong>{{ success===null?'—':success.toFixed(1)+'%' }}</strong><small>建连成功率</small></div></div><dl><div><dt>P50 建连</dt><dd>{{ milliseconds(state.telemetry.connections?.p50_ms) }}</dd></div><div><dt>P95 建连</dt><dd>{{ milliseconds(state.telemetry.connections?.p95_ms) }}</dd></div><div><dt>采样连接</dt><dd>{{ state.telemetry.connections?.samples || 0 }}</dd></div></dl></div><div class="quality-footer"><span>备用命中 <strong>{{ state.telemetry.counters.fallback || 0 }}</strong></span><span>竞速成功 <strong>{{ state.telemetry.counters.raced || 0 }}</strong></span><span>隧道中断 <strong>{{ state.telemetry.counters.interrupted || 0 }}</strong></span></div></article></div>
 <section class="panel route-health-panel"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow muted">ADAPTIVE ROUTING</span><h3>上游状态</h3><p>近期观测影响新连接的排序；连续失败会短暂降权，随后仍可恢复尝试。</p></div><span class="badge subtle">5 分钟观测有效期</span></div><div class="upstream-cards"><article v-for="(route,index) in state.network?.routes || []" :key="route.key" class="upstream-health"><div class="upstream-health-title"><strong>{{ index===0?'主入口':'备用入口' }} · {{ route.host }}:{{ route.port }}</strong><span class="badge" :class="{success:route.attempts>0 && !route.cooldown_seconds}">{{ route.cooldown_seconds?`降权 ${route.cooldown_seconds}s`:route.attempts?'已观测':'等待采样' }}</span></div><div class="upstream-health-metrics"><span>CONNECT 平滑耗时<strong>{{ milliseconds(route.ewma_ms) }}</strong></span><span>成功 / 尝试<strong>{{ route.succeeded }} / {{ route.attempts }}</strong></span><span>当前优先级<strong>{{ state.config.route_strategy==='ordered'?index+1:route.rank }}</strong></span><span>TLS / HTTP 中位数<strong>{{ milliseconds(route.probe_ms) }}</strong></span></div></article></div></section>
 <section class="panel path-benchmark"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow muted">MEASURE, THEN OPTIMIZE</span><h3>实测路径表现</h3><p>对 Codex、Gemini 各测 3 轮，比较每个入口与实际中继的 TLS／HTTP 到达耗时。</p></div><button v-if="!measure?.running" class="btn secondary" :disabled="!!busy || state.operation.running" @click="emit('action','network.measure',{},'路径评估已开始，将逐步显示结果。')"><Icon name="play" :size="16"/>评估路径</button><button v-else class="btn secondary" :disabled="!!busy" @click="emit('action','network.measure.cancel',{},'已请求取消，将等待当前请求结束。')"><Icon name="pause" :size="16"/>取消评估</button></div><div v-if="measure" class="benchmark-status" role="status"><span>{{ measure.running?'正在测量':measure.cancelled?'已取消':measure.error?'未完成':'检测完成' }} · {{ measure.completed }} / {{ measure.total }} 个样本</span><span v-if="benchmarkStale">结果已过期或策略已修改，请重新评估</span><span v-else-if="measure.best && !measure.running">观测较快入口：{{ state.config.upstreams[Number(measure.best.split('-')[1])]?.port }} · 自适应策略已参考此结果</span></div><div v-if="measure?.running" class="progress-track"><div :style="{width:`${measure.completed/measure.total*100}%`}"></div></div><div v-if="measure?.summaries.length" class="benchmark-chart"><div v-for="route in measure.summaries" :key="route.key" class="benchmark-row"><strong>{{ route.key==='relay'?'优化中继':`入口 ${route.port}` }}</strong><div class="benchmark-bar"><i :style="{width:`${route.p50_ms?Math.max(2,route.p50_ms/Math.max(...measure.summaries.map(s=>s.p50_ms || 1))*100):0}%`}"></i></div><span>{{ milliseconds(route.p50_ms) }}</span><small>{{ route.succeeded }} / {{ route.attempts }} 到达</small></div></div><div v-else-if="!measure?.running" class="benchmark-empty"><Icon name="pulse" :size="22"/>尚无路径评估，点击后使用实际连接采样。</div><p class="micro-copy">HEAD 不发送模型生成请求。耗时包含代理、TLS 与 HTTP；服务返回 401／405 仍可证明到达。结果受 VPN、服务负载影响，不代表下载测速或保证提速。</p></section>
</section>
</template>
